# Device-level XNU patch series.
#
# Empty on purpose: the Meizu 15 reuses the arch (ARMv8.0), soc (SDM660) and os
# (iOS 16.7.16 / 20H392) series from the UniXNU modules unchanged. A device
# series is only needed when this phone requires a patch those three do not
# carry -- e.g. a Synaptics DSX touch driver, or the eMMC (qcom,sdhci-msm-v5)
# native block driver once it exists.
#
# Format: one "NNNN-name.patch" per line, applied in order, paths relative to
# this directory.
